  "en": {
    "kind": "Song cycle",
    "about": [
      "The first Politeia cycle (1961), with lyrics by Dimitris Christodoulou and Tasos Leivaditis, was written in the same period as Archipelagos but is darker: urban, built on zeibekiko and chasapiko rhythms. Stelios Kazantzidis, Grigoris Bithikotsis and Marinella sing, with bouzouki by Manolis Chiotis.",
      "The second cycle (1964) has lyrics by Varnalis, Gatsos, Christodoulou and Kokkinopoulos, with Bithikotsis as lead singer. In 1976 the two cycles were issued together on LP. The series continued later with Politeia C and Politeia D."
    ]
  }
